    "GateMatrix RZ builds complex exp at imaginary theta/2;SX/X entries are exact dyadics.",
    "num-complex0.4.6 multiplication uses four real products and two component sums;Rust matmul_1q has two complex terms per matrix entry.",
    "num-complex exp calls exp(re) and from_polar cos/sin;matrix evaluation requires a separate uniform bound.",
    "DAG/CircuitData float phases apply rem_euclid(2*binary64PI);ParameterExpression phases bypass float normalization until cast.",
    "BasisTranslator search assigns native gate cost1 and uses additive rule costs;U->U3->3RZ+2SX provides a five-node witness.",
